Error [E0985]: `var` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/lambda_mut_borrow_conflict.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     var total = 0;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name := value` instead of `var name = value`

Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/lambda_mut_borrow_conflict.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     val f = (n: Int) => { total += n; };
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`
